---
title: Contact
metaTitle: Contact | Keystone Neuroinformatics
metaDescription: Contact Keystone Neuroinformatics for general inquiries, collaboration discussions, research questions, and future project conversations.
canonicalPath: /contact/
permalink: /contact/index.html
eyebrow: Contact
intro: Direct email remains the main contact workflow, with collaboration discussions routed through a more structured intake page.
---
<section>
  <div class="contact-grid">
    <article class="contact-panel contact-card contact-card-primary">
      <h2>General inquiries</h2>
      <p class="contact-note">Use the main address for broad questions about the organization, website, or future updates.</p>
      <div class="contact-link-row">
        <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:{{ site.contact.info }}">{{ site.contact.info }}</a>
        <button class="copy-email-btn" data-email="{{ site.contact.info }}" aria-label="Copy {{ site.contact.info }} to clipboard">Copy</button>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="contact-panel contact-card contact-card-primary">
      <h2>Collaboration requests</h2>
      <p class="contact-note">For research, data, or strategy discussions, use the collaboration address or the structured intake flow.</p>
      <div class="contact-link-row">
        <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:{{ site.contact.collaborate }}">{{ site.contact.collaborate }}</a>
        <button class="copy-email-btn" data-email="{{ site.contact.collaborate }}" aria-label="Copy {{ site.contact.collaborate }} to clipboard">Copy</button>
      </div>
      <p><a class="button button-secondary-dark" href="/collaborate/">Open structured intake</a></p>
    </article>

    <article class="contact-panel contact-card contact-card-full">
      <h2>Suggested inquiry types</h2>
      <ul class="list-clean topic-list">
        {% for item in site.inquiryTypes %}
        <li>{{ item }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="callout">
  <h2>Best-fit themes</h2>
  <p>The clearest fit for this site is work related to clinical AI, computational psychiatry, multimodal behavioral health data, and translational psychiatric research. Research and project updates will appear in the <a href="/research/">Research and Updates</a> archive as they are published.</p>
</section>
